WEBVTT

00:09:29.030 --> 00:09:31.340
but clearly don't believe it yet,

00:09:31.364 --> 00:09:33.475
because if you believed
that that was coming,

00:09:33.499 --> 00:09:34.906
and say, in three-years' time

00:09:34.930 --> 00:09:37.181
this device, with a two-
or three-second delay,

00:09:37.205 --> 00:09:39.241
but that means that in eight-years' time,

00:09:39.265 --> 00:09:41.654
there's a device
with less than a one-second delay.

00:09:41.678 --> 00:09:43.745
The implications of that
are so astonishing.

00:09:43.769 --> 00:09:48.034
First of all, in terms of lots of jobs
that are there right now get taken out,

00:09:48.058 --> 00:09:50.279
but perhaps more interestingly,

00:09:50.303 --> 00:09:53.803
just huge amounts more
of connection, I imagine.

00:09:53.827 --> 00:09:55.784
So many people who right now

00:09:55.808 --> 00:09:58.593
maybe don't want to spend
too much time in a foreign place,

00:09:58.617 --> 00:10:01.109
or if they do, they don't really
connect with people